le;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#5F6B7A;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r-1188" target="r-1390"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-1452" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERoneToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#5F6B7A;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r-1380" target="r-1426"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-1453" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#5F6B7A;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r-1309" target="r-1431"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-1454" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt; (Crow's Foot)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;underlined&lt;/u&gt; = primary-key column&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;NULL&lt;/i&gt; = nullable column (blank = NOT NULL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1F5FAD&quot;&gt;type → table&lt;/span&gt; = FK whose line is not drawn here&lt;br&gt;Dashed table = reference stub (detailed on another page)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Line ends&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;┤├ exactly one &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; o┤ zero or one&lt;br&gt;o&amp;lt; zero or many &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ┤&amp;lt; one or many&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Composite / multi-column UNIQUE constraints, CHECK&lt;br&gt;constraints and append-only triggers are listed in&lt;br&gt;docs/database/DATABASE_DESIGN.md." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#C8CDD3;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="300" width="340" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note-1455" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE (purchase_id, product_id) and (purchase_id, line_no) on purchase_items.&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE (receipt_id, purchase_item_id) on purchase_receipt_items.&lt;br&gt;• CHECK 0 ≤ received_quantity ≤ quantity prevents over-receiving.&lt;br&gt;• purchase_receipts / purchase_receipt_items are append-only (trigger).&lt;br&gt;• product_name / product_sku are historical snapshots." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#E0C068;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="580" width="340" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
